<title>ESTONIA: MINIMUM QUANTITY FOR VOUCHER TRADE ANNOUNCED.</title>
<headline>MINIMUM QUANTITY FOR VOUCHER TRADE ANNOUNCED.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tallinn Stock Exchange announced the price step and minimum quantity for privatisation vouchers (EVP) on Thursday.</p>
<p>The vouchers, traded on the free market of the Tallinn bourse from next Monday, have a price step of 0.1 and minimum quantity 10,000.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
